  "description": "Part single, part double storey rear extension.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed first-floor rear extension in conjunction with the existing rear\r\ndormer, would give rise to an unsympathetic, incongruous, bulky, obtrusive and\r\ncontrived form of development which would fail to respect the scale, character,\r\nmassing, composition and design of the host dwellinghouse and neighbouring\r\nproperties. The proposal would result in a detrimental impact to\r\nthe&amp;nbsp;character and appearance of the subject dwellinghouse and the visual\r\namenities of the area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 (D.1,&amp;nbsp;D.11 and D.12)\r\nof the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan\r\n(2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design\r\nGuide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
